 than the GRU neural network. Overall, these results may provide insights into how the nervous system optimally encodes sequences of items.  ","topics":[],"score":2180},{"name":"Prattbuw/STAT535_Final_Classification_CIFAR10","owner":"Prattbuw","html_url":"https://github.com/Prattbuw/STAT535_Final_Classification_CIFAR10","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"The goal of the final project for STAT 535 at UW was to conduct multi-class classification of the CIFAR10 dataset. I used a convolutional neural network with augmentation to do this and achieved a classification accuracy of 73% on the test set. ","topics":[],"score":2180},{"name":"ivanoats/county-warning-area-boundaries","owner":"ivanoats","html_url":"https://github.com/ivanoats/county-warning-area-boundaries","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":null,"description":"National Weather Service County Warning Area Boundaries","topics":[],"score":2180},{"name":"seonjunmoon/spark-scala-tutorials","owner":"seonjunmoon","html_url":"https://github.com/seonjunmoon/spark-scala-tutorials","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"Scala","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2180},{"name":"analogrelay/pages-on-main","owner":"analogrelay","html_url":"https://github.com/analogrelay/pages-on-main","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"HTML","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2180},{"name":"evannor/hotel-tutorial","owner":"evannor","html_url":"https://github.com/evannor/hotel-tutorial","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"HTML","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2180},{"name":"nconn34/postcardgenerator","owner":"nconn34","html_url":"https://github.com/nconn34/postcardgenerator","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":null,"description":null,"topics":[],"score":2180},{"name":"nconn34/Pierre-sBakery","owner":"nconn34","html_url":"https://github.com/nconn34/Pierre-sBakery","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"C#","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2180},{"na